When creating an issue the job does body = `${issue.body}

${renderScopeBlock(scope)}`; if issue.body contains ```triage-scope
{...}
``` then the first match is the model's, parseScopeBlock returns the wrong Scope (or null on bad JSON), and subsequent rowSatisfiesScope / attachment decisions use the wrong predicate.

